          "en": "Runge interpolation: nodes, representation and rounding"
        },
        "summary": {
          "ja": "Runge関数と絶対値関数を等間隔・Lobatto型の固定節点で補間し、Clenshaw評価と比較します。",
          "en": "Interpolate the Runge and absolute-value functions on fixed equispaced and Lobatto-like nodes, and compare with Clenshaw evaluation."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "無次元区間[-1,1]、次数8・16・32、固定2048中点。節点・データ・重みは実際のbinary64値を対象にします。",
          "en": "Dimensionless interval [-1,1], degrees 8, 16 and 32, and 2048 fixed midpoints. Actual binary64 nodes, data and weights define the discrete problem."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "第2重心公式と全係数Clenshaw漸化式を自作。丸め済み節点上の閉形式重みと有限Chebyshev変換をそのまま保存します。",
          "en": "Implement the second barycentric formula and a full-coefficient Clenshaw recurrence. Retain the closed weights and finite Chebyshev transform on rounded nodes."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "格納値の補間多項式P、閉重み有理式R、格納係数級数C、目標関数fを区別。17点の正確な有理参照・演算別誤差上界・節点一致・固定Runge傾向を照合します。",
          "en": "Separate the stored-data polynomial P, closed-weight rational expression R, stored-coefficient series C and target f. Check exact rational references at 17 probes, operation-based error bounds, node identities and fixed Runge trends."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "標本最大誤差は連続一様ノルムの証明ではありません。丸め節点の閉重み・離散直交性は厳密と見なしません。任意次数・任意点の安定性は保証しません。",
          "en": "A sampled maximum error is not a proof of a continuous uniform norm. Closed weights and discrete orthogonality on rounded nodes are not treated as exact. No arbitrary-degree or all-point stability guarantee is made."
        },
